# Line endings.
# Text files are always stored in the repository with LF, regardless of each
# member's `core.autocrlf`, so files no longer show as modified when only
# line endings differ.
# Line endings in the working tree still depend on local Git settings:
# CRLF if `core.autocrlf=true`, LF if `core.autocrlf=input`, otherwise `core.eol`
# (default `native`: CRLF on Windows, LF on Linux/macOS).
* text=auto

# Binary files: never convert.
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.gif   binary
*.ico   binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
